//    fee ends on the 31st day of uninterrupted continuous occupancy).
//  - O.C.G.A. 48-13-51(h)(4) — the local hotel-motel excise tax exempts only
//    "charges made for continuous use ... after the first 30 days of continuous
//    occupancy", so the FIRST 30 days are taxed. House Bill 492 (2025-2026)
//    would repeal that exemption; it sits in House Ways & Means.
//  - FEMA OpenFEMA Disaster Declarations Summaries, queried per county, for
//    every disaster number, incident date and Individual Assistance designation.
