//    temporary housing pages, and United Policyholders for the placement chain
//    and the comparability standard.
//
// The Atlanta 30-day ordinance DEFINITION is stated in exactly ONE entry
// (mid-term-rental-management:atlanta) because that is the only city it governs.
// Elsewhere it appears only as a contrast — "this is not Atlanta, here is what
// actually applies" — which is the opposite of duplication.
//
// Keys deliberately absent: many cities have no distinct mid-term or insurance
// story that is true only there. Those render nothing, which is correct.

